<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-11-05T11:16:51.491Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 11:16:51 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Turkey has intensified airstrikes supporting the Somali president, raising civilian casualties, while Uganda is accelerating its troop withdrawal from Somalia and Ethiopia is planning a similar pullout as fighting intensifies. The United States has withdrawn its forces from the strategic Baledogle airfield, and U.S. and an East African nation continue joint airstrikes against an al-Qaeda-linked group. Somali forces are being urged to intensify operations against al-Shabaab near Barawe, and a Somali police officer was killed by an aircraft propeller at Dhusamareb Airport. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxNOVlNOGdWZGNMcExOVVJvcWJoUTIzdVl2X3A1MWNmbzZyd2M5cFBPZmJ3SnQtMFBYdFdXMFhCdDhsX2QzY0lHYkF0Z216VVo0MUV0azNTRE1wUnAtUTZZM0lKdldFUDRxTE5Md004ZzBkS1dMTGVuWmlSZHhyemtmN0N6cTFqQ3lFeC1NRHgwUlh6SV93OVZkU0ZKbDFsZGtFeUhB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxON1NUWFFwY2dfX002Nm40NWVSdlROclFWazV4X3hGd2hIQ1FNMndwRlNmTVRnZ2lGbjNza3hxSEhLaFFVaWxZTVRrWDFvR3hkTkdCR3V4X0s5MTlRbmJxeS0wRlBrcFI5MzljaE55cFBuQVlaS19rTXVDS19vSjFKZGFET0pyNVhBZFJWaC1QUUF0VHg5T1BxRWZ4WV_SAZwBQVVfeXFMTkV4RXZxSkhTYmdkdVV5UVl1SXlNUTNaRFFBZVdINTBCMHdJdUtJRHBlX1gxendROHhXeFJ5d3htWkdVQVpnQzRoOFZlQjIyRG10T0dGbGdfdTNyaFowdzJya2U2UVR6U0xBN05TSlFQRURWaXRXM1UwMjV3T2daVWtfWUY2a2NSaGNfdFZkVmRiWWhQWjBIcm55OWlI?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE81bGVRY3l6VXVxMm9GWmJDVmRRTHNNaU1SYlQ5QUU5VURWV0RWSmlPRGh5SWlTS1JBM1YtRGp0S0I3WUNBZEdmZVh2cXFBVHMtRkp6MjM0NUVTUTA?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMis